' Ditulis manual. Communication diagram (emulasi) — mencatat pembayaran.
@startuml communication
!include _gaya.iuml
title Communication Diagram — Mencatat Pembayaran

actor "Admin/Staf" as Admin
rectangle ":PaymentForm" as Form
rectangle ":createPaymentAction" as Act
rectangle ":tagihan" as T
rectangle ":pembayaran" as P
rectangle ":alokasi_pembayaran" as A
rectangle ":log_audit" as L

Admin -right- Form : 1: pilih siswa & isi alokasi →\n2: klik Catat Pembayaran →
Form -right- Act : 3: kirim formulir →
Act -down- T : 4: ambil sisa tagihan →\n7: perbarui status (PAID/PARTIAL) →
Act -right- P : 5: simpan kwitansi (POSTED) →
P -down- A : 6: simpan alokasi per tagihan →
Act -up- L : 8: catat PAYMENT_CREATE →
@enduml
